                                    <p class="ecl-u-type-paragraph">In this episode we are talking about the European Statistics Competition (ESC). We will explore how it helps young people develop statistical literacy through exciting video projects, and how it teaches them critical thinking and data interpretation skills in a funny way, relevant to their lives.</p>

