                                    </p>
                                    <p class="ecl-u-type-paragraph">In this episode we talk about quality. Easy to spot in everyday things like food and clothing. But how about statistics? Eurostat has a team dedicated to this topic, and we'll hear how Eurostat with its European Statistics Code of Practice has set the standards for the entire European Statistical System, and how they monitor and implement it.</p>

<p class="ecl-u-type-paragraph">The podcasts speakers are Claudia Junker, Head of Unit, Task Force Peer Reviews and Quality, Dean Vuletic, both from Eurostat, and Francesca Cimino, audience researcher at the European Broadcasting Union (EBU). In their exchange with podcast host John Elliot, they will show us why quality data are the backbone of today’s statistics.</p>
